#. Tag: title
#: man-kenolaba.6.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripcion"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kenolaba.6.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kenolaba; is a simple board strategy game that is played by two players. "
"There are red and yellow pieces for each player. Beginning from a start "
"position where each player has 14 pieces, moves are drawn until one player "
"has pushed 6 of his opponent's pieces out of the board."
msgstr ""

